WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Awaken. A single pearl of liquid rises from a splash in darkness; a woman’s face is reflected inside it.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
Skin. A bead of cream on deep brown skin, seen in extreme close-up.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
Touch. A woman with eyes closed smooths cream onto her cheek in warm light.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
The Restoration Field. Ribbons and droplets of golden light move like moisture across skin.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.000
The ingredient world. Shea nuts, coconut and golden oil spheres in a glowing still life.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.000
The glow returns. A woman’s face in close-up, glowing, confident and radiant.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.400
Product reveal. Miss Rhee Beauty body lotion, body butters and oil on a stone plinth, draped in cream silk.

00:19.400 --> 00:20.090
Brand lock-up. The MR monogram on black: The Space of Restoration. Restore your natural beauty and your skin will thank you.
